invalid type: string "[Ang 258 | Raag: Raag Gauree | Author: Guru Arjan Dev Ji]\nGurbani: ਪਉੜੀ ॥\nTransliteration: paurree |\nEnglish: Pauree:\n\nGurbani: ਭਭਾ ਭਰਮ\u{a41} ਮਿਟਾਵਹ\u{a41} ਅਪਨਾ ॥\nTransliteration: bhabhaa bharam mittaavahu apanaa |\nEnglish: BHABHA: Cast out your doubt and delusion\n\nGurbani: ਇਆ ਸ\u{a70}ਸਾਰ\u{a41} ਸਗਲ ਹ��